0 FILE 10022 - main.ldr
0 Santa Fe Super Chief Sleeping Car (set 10022-1) — a light grey and dark grey passenger train sleeping car with grilled side panels, glazed windows, log-textured ends, opening side doors with glass, a curved-arch roof, an interior with compartment partitions, minifig seats and a washbasin, yellow marker-light plates, Santa Fe SANTA FE lettering and 66 number stickers, and two single-axle wheel bogies with magnetic couplings
